/** \page requirements Requirements

@section SupportedTools Supported Platforms and Toolsets

Most modules of the Platinum C++ framework can be compiled for any platform
that provides an ISO C++ implementation, the system dependent parts of %Pt 
are designed to be very portable. The %Pt build process supports a variety
of platforms and compilers. The supported operating systems include Windows
2000/XP/Vista, Windows Mobile 5.x/6.x, Linux, MacOS-X, AIX, Solaris and QNX.
Big-endian as well as little-endian architectures are supported,
including X86, X86-64, PPC, Sparc, ARM, MIPS and SH. 64-bit support
is available for the respective platforms.
*/
